 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{7C56655ECA12145C}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "<h2>Enemy Forces</h2>"\
     "Separatist forces have captured the mine last night, killing the existing security forces on-site. There are, at most, 25 fighters on-site carrying small arms and machine guns."\
     ""\
     "<b>Most Likely Course of Action</b>"\
     "Separatist forces will dig into and around the mine to prevent it's recapture. Random patrols or early-warning teams may be dispatched."\
     ""\
     "<b>Most Dangerous Course of Action</b>"\
     "Separatist forces will feign a retreat, moving completely off the mine to a nearby point and ambush Canadian units from the rear."\
     ""\
     "<h2>Friendly Forces</h2>"\
     "Two platoons of Canadian Light Infantry with supporting company command element. Weapon squads have been detached for block element efforts."\
     ""\
     "The company has been formed at the CAF RP point."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{A897F37E07BC715D}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "<h2>Enemy Forces</h2>"\
     "Canadian forces have been dispatched to try and re-secure this mine. Our informants say their weapons teams have been pulled off the assault, so it's two light infantry platoons and a command unit. They appear to be light infantry, so no heavy weapons or vehicles."\
     ""\
     "<b>Most Likely Course of Action</b>"\
     "One platoon will act as a maneuver element while the other platoon acts as a BOF or backup platoon. They will choose one point of attack to focus their assault. "\
     ""\
     "<b>Most Dangerous Course of Action</b>"\
     "The two platoons conduct a dual assault, one focusing on the lower portion of the mine, the other focusing on the top of the mine, pincering any fighters in the center."\
     ""\
     "<h2>Friendly Forces</h2>"\
     "We are sepeartists. We have about 25 men total (maybe?). "\
     ""\
     "NOTE: There is a cave system that connects the lower portion of the mine to the upper portion."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{4DABE76933473365}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "CAF is to re-secure the mine from separatist forces."\
     ""\
     "The facility is surrounded by fences. It is HIGHLY RECOMMENDED you take all the wire cutters."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{BA5CB02BBED83158}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "Defend the mine from the CAF."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{075F5BF975C21B6F}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "Service Support"
     m_sContent "20 wirecutters and 5 telescopic ladders have been provided for the assault. Grab them at the box."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{01FCF3B4E7D5EC48}" {
     m_iOrder 5
